                                        </blockquote>
                                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=face" 
                                                    class="rounded-circle me-3" width="60" height="60" alt="Client">
                                            <div class="text-start">
                                                <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">John Smith</h6>
                                                <small class="text-muted">CEO, TechCorp</small>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="carousel-item">
                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                            <div class="col-lg-8">
                                <div class="testimonial-card card border-0 shadow-sm">
                                    <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                                        <div class="stars mb-3">
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <blockquote class="blockquote mb-4">
                                            <p class="lead">"Professional service, amazing results. Highly recommend TechFlow!"</p>
                                        </blockquote>
                                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                                            <img src="https://pulitzercenter.org/sites/default/files/2023-06/Sarah%20Johnson.JPG?w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=face" 
                                                    class="rounded-circle me-3" width="60" height="60" alt="Client">
                                            <div class="text-start">
                                                <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Sarah Johnson</h6>
                                                <small class="text-muted">CTO, InnovateCorp</small>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="carousel-item">
                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                            <div class="col-lg-8">
                                <div class="testimonial-card card border-0 shadow-sm">
                                    <div class="card-body text-center p-5">
                                        <div class="stars mb-3">
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <blockquote class="blockquote mb-4">
                                            <p class="lead">"Exceptional quality and support. TechFlow exceeded all expectations!"</p>
                                        </blockquote>
                                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=80&h=80&fit=crop&crop=face" 
                                                    class="rounded-circle me-3" width="60" height="60" alt="Client">
                                            <div class="text-start">
                                                <h6 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Mike Davis</h6>
                                                <small class="text-muted">Founder, StartupHub</small>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#testimonialCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
                    <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#testimonialCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
                    <span class="carousel-control-next-icon"></span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
